Figures of tables, tables in figures and subfigures (plan P3-03).

#!figure(label: "fig-tab")
#!table(cols: 2, label: "tab-in")
Name | Qty
Alpha | 2
#table!
A figure whose body is one table numbers as a table.
#figure!

#!figure(kind: "figure", label: "fig-kept")
#!table(cols: 2)
Name | Qty
Beta | 3
#table!
Its kind says figure: it numbers as a figure.
#figure!

#!figure(label: "fig-pair")
#!figure(src: "a.png", w: 100, h: 50, label: "fig-a")
The left view.
#figure!
#!figure(src: "b.png", w: 100, h: 50, label: "fig-b")
The right view.
#figure!
Two views of one thing.
#figure!

See @fig-tab (and @tab-in, its table), @fig-kept, @fig-pair, @fig-a and @fig-b.
